In the **Authorization** screen, the "Pending Since" timer correctly shows the time elapsed since the *last action* (meaning how long the batch has been waiting at the *current* stage). However, in the **Status** screen, it was hardcoded to calculate the time since the requestDate (meaning the *total* time since the batch was first created).
To perfectly synchronize the Status screen so it matches the Authorization screen logic, we will use the workflowHistory array to grab the exact timestamp of the last action.
